    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d792">

                <pb facs="0868" n="780" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg780"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCormick to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic">May 11,
                        1904</hi></date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 132.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith some
                    extracts from the report of the Russian minister to Korea, Mr. Pavloff, with
                    reference to the naval action off the Bay of Chemulpo and the action of Captain
                    Marshall of the <hi rendition="#italic">Vicksburg</hi>, which I am sure will be
                    of interest both to the Department of State and the Navy Department.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert S.
                    McCormick.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d792-a1.xml" xpointer="d792-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
